 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ready"},{"text":" is a loading failure and arrives here as ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/ExpoFpPlanStatus\/error(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The same failure after the plan became "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ready"},{"type":"text","text":" arrives in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/IExpoFpPlanPresenter\/planOperationalErrorPublisher","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Check-operational-errors","text":"Check operational errors","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Subscribe to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/IExpoFpPlanPresenter\/planOperationalErrorPublisher"},{"text":" to react to errors occurred while the plan is operating – navigation failures and plan termination after the plan became ","type":"text"},{"code":"ready","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and location provider failures at any moment. Such errors do not change ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/IExpoFpPlanPresenter\/planStatusPublisher","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", so the plan keeps the last status. After a navigation or location provider failure it also remains usable, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/ExpoFpError\/planDidTerminate"},{"type":"text","text":" is the exception – see below:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Subscribe before presenting the plan, so early errors are not missed.","presenter.planOperationalErrorPublisher.sink { error in","    \/\/ for example show a banner: the Blue Dot is unavailable","}",".store(in: &cancellables)","","let controller = presenter.getViewController()"],"sy